# The lock (GEAR.md G4): the lockkeeper's core in a pack frame. A narrow way
# walked through among the pines by a hunted player is shut behind them to
# machines: a bar of
# drowned light across it while it holds.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lock.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --fit=glide_wing,mod_lock --give=wick:4
coast calm
place pinewood
wait 1.0
# A way through the pines by name (40_fight `tour_place`: two solids no wider
# apart than the lock shuts), the player on its near side. A timed walk in a
# heading met no gap once the scatter laid new pines, and the lock never came.
near gap
wait 0.6
# Hunted: a runner out of the trees has the player.
spawn runner
await noticed 10
# Out through the way with it coming on behind: shut behind him.
walkto gap 6
await locked 1.0
wait 0.3
shot 01-a-way-shut-behind with prop:pine,mob:runner
# At eye level: the runner stopped at the shut way, and the sheet of light it
# will not pass.
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
wait 0.8
shot 02-stopped-at-it-over-the-shoulder with shoulder,mob:runner
